  title: Sikhs
  text: After Guru Gobind Singh created the Khalsa in 1699, Sikh groups called misls rose in Punjab. Maharaja Ranjit Singh united them and ruled a strong kingdom from Lahore from 1799 to 1839, with a modern army.
